msgstr "desde (hora)"

msgid "to (time)"
msgstr "hasta (hora)"

msgid "share reduced (%)"
msgstr "parte reducida (%)"

msgid ""
"Only for a suspension that reduces the working day instead of stopping it. "
"Empty means the whole day. 40 means they still work 60 %."
msgstr ""
"Solo para una suspensión que reduce la jornada en vez de pararla. Vacío "
"significa el día entero. 40 significa que se sigue trabajando el 60 %."

msgid "reason"
msgstr "motivo"

msgid "status"
msgstr "estado"

msgid "resolved by"
msgstr "resuelta por"

msgid "resolved at"
msgstr "resuelta el"

msgid "supporting document"
msgstr "justificante"

msgid ""
"Not available for sick leave: the medical certificate is not stored here. "
"Since RD 1060/2022 the worker no longer hands it to the employer --- the "
"INSS sends the data to the company directly."
msgstr ""
"No disponible en las bajas médicas: el parte no se guarda aquí. Desde el RD "
"1060/2022 el trabajador ya no lo entrega a la empresa: el INSS le remite los "
"datos directamente."

msgid "absence"
msgstr "ausencia"

msgid "absences"
msgstr "ausencias"

msgid "The end date cannot precede the start date."
msgstr "La fecha final no puede ir antes que la inicial."

msgid "Give both times, or neither: half of a range is not one."
msgstr "Pon las dos horas o ninguna: media franja no es una franja."

msgid "It ends before it starts."
msgstr "Acaba antes de empezar."

msgid ""
"Part of a day is one day. For several days, leave the times empty and they "
"count whole."
msgstr ""
"Parte de un día es un día. Para varios días deja las horas vacías y cuentan "
"enteros."

msgid ""
"The medical certificate is not stored. Recording the absence, its dates and "
"its status is enough for working-time purposes, and since RD 1060/2022 the "
"worker does not hand the certificate to the employer: the INSS sends the "
"data to the company."
msgstr ""
"El parte de baja no se almacena. Para el control horario basta con registrar "
"la ausencia, sus fechas y su estado, y desde el RD 1060/2022 el trabajador "
"no entrega el parte a la empresa: se lo remite el INSS."

msgid "No deadline (art. 38.3, second paragraph)"
msgstr "Sin plazo (art. 38.3, párrafo segundo)"

msgid "Eighteen months (art. 38.3, third paragraph)"
msgstr "Dieciocho meses (art. 38.3, párrafo tercero)"

msgid "Waiting to be confirmed"
msgstr "Pendiente de confirmar"

msgid "Confirmed"
msgstr "Confirmada"

msgid "Not applicable"
msgstr "No procede"

msgid "holiday affected"
msgstr "vacaciones afectadas"

msgid "leave that overlapped"
msgstr "ausencia que las pisó"

msgid "days"
msgstr "días"

msgid "counted in working days"
msgstr "contados en días laborables"

msgid "regime"
msgstr "régimen"

msgid "must be taken by"
msgstr "hay que disfrutarlas antes del"

msgid "confirmed by"
msgstr "confirmada por"

msgid "confirmed at"
msgstr "confirmada el"

msgid "recovered holiday"
msgstr "vacaciones recuperadas"

msgid "recovered holidays"
msgstr "vacaciones recuperadas"

msgid "That recovery has already been decided."
msgstr "Esa recuperación ya se resolvió."

msgid "a holiday recovery"
msgstr "una recuperación de vacaciones"

msgid "Say what kind of leave it is."
msgstr "Di de qué tipo de ausencia se trata."

msgid ""
"The medical certificate is not stored. Recording the absence, its dates and "
"its status is enough, and since RD 1060/2022 the worker does not hand the "
"certificate to the employer."
msgstr ""
"El parte de baja no se almacena. Basta con registrar la ausencia, sus fechas "
"y su estado, y desde el RD 1060/2022 el trabajador no entrega el parte a la "
"empresa."

#, python-format
msgid "There is already leave recorded between %(from)s and %(to)s."
msgstr "Ya hay una ausencia registrada entre el %(from)s y el %(to)s."

msgid ""
"Say which suspension it is: they carry different articles and different "
"consequences, and the record has to name one."
msgstr ""
"Di qué suspensión es: llevan artículos y consecuencias distintas, y el "
"registro tiene que nombrar una."

msgid ""
"A reduction covers whole days at a smaller share. For hours away on one day, "
"leave the reduction empty."
msgstr ""
"Una reducción cubre días enteros a una jornada menor. Para horas sueltas de "
"un día, deja la reducción vacía."

msgid ""
"Only a suspension can reduce the working day. For fewer hours by agreement, "
"change the contracted figure on the person."
msgstr ""
"Solo una suspensión puede reducir la jornada. Para menos horas por acuerdo, "
"cambia las horas contratadas de la persona."

msgid ""
"Only a suspension the company records --- an ERTE, the RED mechanism --- can "
"reduce the working day."
msgstr ""
"Solo una suspensión de las que registra la empresa —un ERTE, el mecanismo RED"
"— puede reducir la jornada."

msgid ""
"Holiday is taken in whole days. For part of a day, use the leave type that "
"fits: a medical appointment, family emergency, an exam."
msgstr ""
"Las vacaciones se cogen por días completos. Para parte de un día usa el "
"permiso que corresponda: visita médica, fuerza mayor familiar, un examen."

msgid "leave"
msgstr "una ausencia"

msgid "Leave has since been approved for those dates."
msgstr "Mientras tanto se ha aprobado otra ausencia para esas fechas."

msgid "That request belongs to somebody else."
msgstr "Esa solicitud es de otra persona."

msgid "This request has already been resolved."
msgstr "Esta solicitud ya está resuelta."

#, python-format
msgid "Only a PDF or an image: %(allowed_extensions)s."
msgstr "Solo un PDF o una imagen: %(allowed_extensions)s."

#, python-format
msgid "The file is %(size).1f MB and the limit is %(limit)s MB."
msgstr "El fichero ocupa %(size).1f MB y el límite son %(limit)s MB."

msgid "the time it takes"
msgstr "el tiempo indispensable"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(count)s absences use it. Deactivate it instead: deleting would take the "
"reason off records that have to survive four years."
msgstr ""
"Lo usan %(count)s ausencias. Desactívalo en vez de borrarlo: borrarlo le "
"quitaría el motivo a registros que tienen que durar cuatro años."

msgid "That person is not in this company."
msgstr "Esa persona no pertenece a esta empresa."

msgid "Leave can only be requested for yourself."
msgstr "Solo puedes solicitar ausencias para ti."

msgid "That leave type does not exist or is no longer in use."
msgstr "Ese tipo de permiso no existe o ya no está en uso."

msgid ""
"This kind of leave is recorded by the company, not requested. Talk to "
"whoever manages your working time."
msgstr ""
"Este tipo de ausencia la registra la empresa, no se solicita. Habla con "
"quien gestione tu jornada."

msgid "You can only see your own balance."
msgstr "Solo puedes consultar tu propio saldo."

msgid "Give 'from' and 'to' as YYYY-MM-DD."
msgstr "Indica 'from' y 'to' con el formato AAAA-MM-DD."

msgid "Read somebody else's record"
msgstr "Consultó el registro de otra persona"

